{{c|{{smaller|Apricot (''Prunus Armeniaca'').}}}}
pubescent, orange-colored fruit, of a rich aromatic flavor, the produce of a tree of the plum kind, ''Prunus Armeniaca'', natural order ''Rosaceæ''. {{smaller|Its specific name is due to the belief that it is a native of Armenia, but it is now supposed to be of Chinese origin.}}
